s, news and events from the UK government in UK Mission to the United Nations, New York","document_type":"world_location_news","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2013-03-25T23:11:41Z","schema_name":"world_location_news","title":"UK Mission to the United Nations (New York)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/world/uk-mission-to-the-united-nations-new-york","withdrawn":false}]},"locale":"en","phase":"live","public_updated_at":"2026-07-22T17:56:57+01:00","publishing_app":"whitehall","publishing_request_id":"21-1784739302.542-10.13.22.184-2676","publishing_scheduled_at":null,"rendering_app":"frontend","scheduled_publishing_delay_seconds":null,"schema_name":"speech","title":"The United Kingdom is supporting African partners to strengthen critical minerals governance: UK statement at the UN Security Council","updated_at":"2026-09-15T09:09:43+01:00","withdrawn_notice":{}}